<title>HONG KONG: Great Eagle year net rises 28.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Great Eagle year net rises 28.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   230.0	 vs  179.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    60.5	  vs  53.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  396.73 gain vs  326.09 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    1,055.39    vs  820.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,237.09    vs  2,267.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Great Eagle Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 12-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment holding and property development firm Great Eagle provides building materials and property management services.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings was adjusted as a result of issue of scrip dividend shares.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 80 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 19.5 cents) vs 72 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
